      "content": "Step 6: Image Styling"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Use flexbox to center the image within the background section of the card."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<div class=\"container\">\n2    <div class=\"card\">\n3        <div class=\"background\">\n4            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n5                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/jane-austen.jpg\" alt=\"Jane Austen's profile picture\">\n6            </div>\n7        </div>\n8\n9        <div class=\"content\">\n10            <h2>Jane Austen</h2>\n11\n12            <p>\n13                Frontend Developer\n14                <br>\n15                <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\" title=\"Programiz\">Programiz</a>\n16            </p>\n17\n18            <ul class=\"chips\">\n19                <li class=\"chip\">Figma</li>\n20                <li class=\"chip\">ReactJS</li>\n21                <li class=\"chip\">NodeJS</li>\n22            </ul>\n23            <div class=\"action-button\">\n24                <a href=\"#contact-me\" title=\"Contact Me\">Contact Me</a>\n25                <a href=\"#portfolio\" title=\"View Portfolio\" class=\"secondary\">View Portfolio</a>\n26            </div>\n27        </div>\n28    </div>\n29</div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1.background {\n2    flex: 1 1 250px;\n3    display: grid;\n4    place-items: center;\n5    background-color: #ebeffa;\n6}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Ensure the image is responsive and fits well within the designated area."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<div class=\"container\">\n2    <div class=\"card\">\n3        <div class=\"background\">\n4            <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n5                <img src=\"/images/learn-css/jane-austen.jpg\" alt=\"Jane Austen's profile picture\">\n6            </div>\n7        </div>\n8\n9        <div class=\"content\">\n10            <h2>Jane Austen</h2>\n11\n12            <p>\n13                Frontend Developer\n14                <br>\n15                <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\" title=\"Programiz\">Programiz</a>\n16            </p>\n17\n18            <ul class=\"chips\">\n19                <li class=\"chip\">Figma</li>\n20                <li class=\"chip\">ReactJS</li>\n21                <li class=\"chip\">NodeJS</li>\n22            </ul>\n23            <div class=\"action-button\">\n24                <a href=\"#contact-me\" title=\"Contact Me\">Contact Me</a>\n25                <a href=\"#portfolio\" title=\"View Portfolio\" class=\"secondary\">View Portfolio</a>\n26            </div>\n27        </div>\n28    </div>\n29</div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1.background .image-wrapper {\n2    display: flex;\n3    width: 220px;\n4    height: 220px;\n5    border-radius: 50%;\n6    overflow: hidden;\n7    box-shadow: 0 8px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n8    border: 1px solid white;\n9}\n10\n11.background img {\n12    max-width: 100%;\n13    height: auto;\n14    object-fit: cover;\n15}"
    },
